 của bao da được đục lỗ hỗ trợ tản nhiệt cho Surface của bạn.\u003cbr /\u003e- Bao da Tommy cho Surface Laptop bằng đai giữ ở 4 góc giúp bao da luôn cố định mà làm mất đi sự thẩm mỹ cho người dùng.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Tương thích với: Surface Laptop 1/2/3/4-13.5inch\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/fd/d3/46/d9a2ae780c6fa8a3ca95c6dcc6dfd799.jpg?v=1634541464444\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/0d/ba/0e/59dcf64c4e5b3a841e936ca92d73d403.jpg?v=1634541465312\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/15/d1/03/28e1a7114e27f2fd7bd5d5ae2680231e.jpg?v=1634541466331\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/40/b7/49/a5ee65df57509f64a486b121837f20d0.jpg?v=1634108165372\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/b8/2c/81/b8d48180713072bf141936ae8e034dc4.jpg?v=1634180182103\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/0c/d1/34/08dccdeebe13dda55a63adf506024658.jpg?v=1634180182986\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/6d/55/34/e0da19762c867c899094d72cc0147532.jpg?v=1634180183991\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/29/86/b8/cc27a19aeb2de4cf9a0bf978f7ac0d74.jpg?v=1634180185169\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/ea/14/6e/65f5cdcb156e73663e94e2779144aa38.jpg?v=1634180214108\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/41/12/73/699c22af0eeb7dff29e2943ed26b5d4c.jpg?v=1634180215121\" data-thumb=\"original\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg 